sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Operator
    participant Agent as Application or agent
    participant Client as Local CLI client
    participant Daemon as Foreground daemon
    participant Watchdog as Lease watchdog thread
    participant Broker as Credential broker
    participant Discord as Gateway and REST
    participant State as Capture and consumer stores

    Operator->>Daemon: Start serve with fixed scope and state directory
    Daemon->>Broker: Request exact-purpose memory lease
    Broker-->>Daemon: Fixed absolute lease deadline
    Daemon->>Watchdog: Arm original SDK lease before Gateway startup
    Daemon->>Discord: Verify bot and channel scope, start Gateway
    Daemon->>State: Restore snapshots and repair completed publication

    Discord-->>Daemon: Ready, Resume, or selected-channel message-create hint
    Daemon->>Daemon: Coalesce pending capture notification
    Daemon->>Discord: Read authoritative messages with bounded REST pages
    Discord-->>Daemon: Messages and referenced reply data
    Daemon->>Daemon: Check author, structured bot mention, and reply identity
    Note over Daemon,State: References, quotes, and attachments remain context
    alt First initialization without backfill
        Daemon->>State: Save newest-message baseline and ignore existing history
    else Saved checkpoint or explicit initial backfill
        loop Bounded sweeps until saved lower boundary is covered
            Daemon->>State: Commit candidates and exact resume progress together
        end
        Daemon->>State: Commit completed coverage
    end
    Daemon->>State: Publish completed outbox with source-ID deduplication

    Operator->>Client: Create named consumer from now or oldest
    Client->>Daemon: Verified local named-pipe request
    Daemon->>State: Register independent cursor at a complete boundary
    Agent->>Client: Run next and await its process
    Client->>Daemon: Request UUID and consumer name
    alt Another waiter is active
        Daemon-->>Client: busy, no payload
    else Request already completed
        Daemon-->>Client: already-completed, no payload
    else Claim awaits acknowledgment
        Daemon-->>Client: pending-ack metadata
    else Eligible event arrives
        Daemon->>State: Commit event, sequence, delivery ID, and request claim
        Daemon-->>Client: Matched delivery
        Client-->>Agent: Write and flush one JSON result, then exit
    end
    Note over Agent,State: Output, exit, and disconnect do not acknowledge handling

    opt Handling completed
        Agent->>Agent: Handle event within separately authorized scope
        Agent->>Client: Ack exact event and delivery with a receipt
        Client->>Daemon: Local acknowledgment request
        Daemon->>State: Record receipt, advance this cursor, clear claim
        Daemon-->>Client: Acknowledged
    end
    opt Outcome is uncertain
        Agent->>Client: Inspect claim and reconcile external handling
        Agent->>Client: Explicitly replay exact delivery if needed
        Client->>Daemon: Replay request
        Daemon-->>Client: Original payload and delivery ID
    end

    Watchdog->>Watchdog: Original SDK lease becomes invalid
    Watchdog->>Daemon: Exit process with code 3
    Daemon--xClient: IPC closes with live capture
    Client-->>Agent: Connected client reports approval-required
    Operator->>Daemon: Explicit offline restart with the same scope
    Daemon->>State: Restore retained captures, claims, and receipts
    Note over Client,State: Offline clients need no Discord credential; empty next returns offline
    Operator->>Daemon: Explicit regular restart to resume live capture and approval
